osition\": m.disposition,\r\n 7671:                 \"rationale\": (m.text or \"\"),\r\n 7672:                 \"at\": _now().isoformat(),\r\n 7673:             },\r\n 7674:         })\r\n 7675:         return Tool.ok(_Ok())\r\n 7676: \r\n 7677: \r\n 7678: # â”€â”€ W15 search_context â€” retrieval into recipe context memory â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€â”€\r\n 7679: # The embeddings sidecar lives alongside the P2 tiering sidecars, under the\r\n 7680: # recipe dir's context/ subdir (context/embeddings.jsonl). INVARIANT o6:\r\n 7681: # search_context and the sidecar NEVER mutate recipe.json â€” search reads the\r\n 7682: # sidecar; the one-time lazy backfill loads the recipe READ-ONLY (no save).\r\n 7683: # No generative/LLM call anywhere here â€” only the existing embed client\r\n 7684: # (principle-6), degrading to token overlap exactly like neuron_search.\r\n 7685: _CONTEXT_SEARCH_KINDS = (\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
