\n  631: (os.kill(pid,0) is POSIX-only â€” on Windows signal 0 is CTRL_C_EVENT); the\r\n  632: slot reaper retries acquisition immediately after freeing a dead slot.\r\n  633: \r\n  634: Suites: claude 1576, edp-pool 306, edp-broker 29 â€” all green (Phoenix\r\n  635: env-fail only). New: tests/test_f38_round6.py. Updated to new contracts:\r\n  636: test_bridge (findings-contract None vs []), test_v7_budget + test_wp2_gates\r\n  637: (caller-scoped audit rows). NOTE: none of these change pool/broker code, so\r\n  638: no stack restart is required for F38.\r\n  639: \r\n  640: ## F39 â€” live pain report + F38 post-review fixes, 2026-08-20\r\n  641: Source 1: the /pain skill's FIRST live catch (docs/pain-points.jsonl,\r\n  642: acceptor-369ca226, 2026-08-19) â€” arm_wiring had no wiring profile for role\r\n  643: `acceptor`, so the card-mandated boot wiring refused and the whole\r\n  644: acceptance pass ran DEAF (ask_above answers could never wake it). FIX:\r\n  645: acceptor added to _WIRING_SPECS (rx.broker(me)), _WIRING_REFLEX_PROMPTS,\r\n  646: heartbeat table; NEW drift gate (test_f39_acceptor_wiring.py) â€” every role\r\n  647: whose toolset grants arm_wiring must have a wiring spec + reflex prompt.\r\n  648: \r\n  649: Source 2: independent post-review of the Opus-4.8 F38 commit (operator\r\n  650: request). Two confirmed, both fixed:\r\n  651: - _caller_recipe treated ANY colon-less caller (`neuron`,\r\n  652:   `acceptor-<hex>`, `curiosity-<hex>`) as a recipe id â€” their spend was\r\n  653:   billed to a phantom recipe instead of the honest unattributed bucket.\r\n  654:   Now: no lineage shape (no `:`) â†’ unattributed.\r\n  655: - _pid_alive (Windows): windll GetLastError() reads stale error state and\r\n  656:   the default c_int restype truncates a 64-bit HANDLE â†’ could misread\r\n  657:   dead-vs-alive at the slot reaper. Now WinDLL(use_last_error=True) +\r\n  658:   get_last_error() + explicit restype/argtypes; live-verified against a\r\n  659:   real and a nonexistent pid.\r\n  660: \r\n  661: Suites: claude 1580, edp-pool 306, edp-broker 29 â€” green (Phoenix\r\n  662: env-fail only). Claude-side only; no stack restart needed.\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
